WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.195
Seller Central UI based fulfillment.

00:00:02.195 --> 00:00:09.220
To assign an order to a delivery associate, first select "Manage Orders" from the Orders menu.

00:00:10.220 --> 00:00:14.560
Find the order you would like to complete and select "Confirm" under the "Appointment" column.

00:00:15.980 --> 00:00:19.640
Here you can add any delivery notes and schedule the delivery.

00:00:20.180 --> 00:00:24.800
For a doorstep delivery, select a specific date from the range and confirm.

00:00:25.720 --> 00:00:29.840
For an attended delivery, you can first call the customer to align schedules.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:34.620
Select the agreed-upon date and time, and then confirm.

00:00:37.700 --> 00:00:42.380
For a room of choice delivery, choose from the options the customer has provided and confirm.

00:00:43.100 --> 00:00:49.184
Once the delivery date has been set, select Assign to choose the delivery associate that will complete

00:00:49.184 --> 00:00:49.900
the job.

00:00:50.900 --> 00:00:53.200
Choose your delivery associate from the list.

00:00:53.960 --> 00:00:59.180
Once you select "Save", all the relevant details are shown on the Manage Orders page.

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:04.360
Once the order is delivered, you can select the "Complete Job" button.

00:01:05.460 --> 00:01:09.960
Use Seller Central UI based fulfillment to enter the order completion details.

00:01:11.220 --> 00:01:14.580
Enter the delivery associate, the date, and the completion time.

00:01:15.740 --> 00:01:16.700
Select "Confirm".

00:01:19.700 --> 00:01:23.920
The order will now be shown as completed on the Manage Orders page.
